[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=50 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="出发前，帕金斯把桌上的三张天气纸摊成一排。最旧那张画着太阳，最新一张只有一大块墨渍。她指给你看纸边的日期，问你想信哪一张。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="墨渍这张。至少看得出它在雨里待过。可我看不懂这里，风向为什么被改了两遍？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="一次是岸上的报告，一次是咱们甲板上测的。楼能挡风，船出了楼后面就挡不住。纸都是真的，拿错地方用，一样会把人送进水里。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她拿起铅笔，发现笔尖断了，便用指甲剥掉一点木头。潮痕看着那支笔，在外套里摸出一截更短的，放在她手边。两个人都没有说谢谢。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="灯塔外侧再加一个观测点。不是多走一圈，经过的时候看一眼浪头，回报要说看见什么，别只报“情况正常”。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="那我报“水很多”，算不算看见的？我刚把右边的靴子晾干，左边又进水了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="算。还得说水往哪儿来。你要是能把靴子也当风向袋，我们就省一件装备。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="拉姆森把靴筒里的一点水倒进桶里。桶上写着“不可饮用”，下面又添了几个更小的字。你弯腰看，是“谁再拿去煮咖啡谁洗锅”。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="上次是谁拿错了？我是不是应该先认一下船上的桶，免得哪天也在旁边留下名字。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="不是你想的那种拿错。上次有人觉得把纸条撕掉，桶就能自动变干净。名字被我们划掉了，怕她以后再也不肯喝咖啡。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="弗莱彻用手背试了试通风口，随后把雨披塞进你的包外层。你说自己已经装过一件，她没有抽出来，只问那件现在能不能不翻包就拿到。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="雨大起来的时候，人会忙着捂耳机。另一只手还要抓东西。你现在能慢慢找，不代表到时候也能。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="那这一件放这里。我回来再把叠法学会，上次折成一团，包里怎么也放不下。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="潮痕站在门边，帽沿一直滴水。你让她进来，她却先看了看地上的干布，像是在判断哪里可以落脚。德雷顿把布往她那边踢过去一点。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="就是拿来踩的。你要一直躲着，它才算白洗了。门别关死，帕金斯一会儿还要搬东西。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="以前这间舱房不能穿湿鞋进。墙上挂着规矩，值班的人会一个一个记。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "fletcher", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="我们这儿也记。谁最后看见我的靴子是干的，麻烦帮我作个证，免得回去又算我保养不好。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "fletcher", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="潮痕迟了一会儿才笑。你发现她认得脚下那块舱板，走过时会避开中间一道接缝。接缝上没有裂口，只是颜色比周围深一点。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "fletcher", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="这里以前是不是开过什么口？你每次都绕开，我差一点跟着绕，还以为下面会漏。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "fletcher", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="有一只检修盖，后来焊起来了。盖下面以前能收热水管。冬天有人把手套藏在那里，轮班的时候就有一双暖的。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "fletcher", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_20"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="现在下面过电缆。手套不能藏，饭盒也不能。你要找热的，去问锅炉间，别自己试。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_21"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她说得很快，潮痕却认真点了头。你本想问起那些轮班的人，又见她把湿帽子攥得很紧，便改问热水还要等多久。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_22"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="你不用每句话都绕开。那些人有些调走，有些没回来。我不一定想讲，但你问过以后，我还能说今天不讲。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_23"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="那我今天问另一件。外面灯亮的时候，你为什么把手藏进袖子里？你一直在看，手却没往耳机那儿去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_24"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="潮痕摊开手掌，里面有一只没装电池的小信号器。外壳上那个凹陷正好能卡住拇指。她把开关推到底，红点没有亮。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_25"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="我以前一紧张就会按。后来拆掉电池，手还是改不过来。它现在发不出信号，你们可以检查。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_26"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="回来以后检查，现在先放好。出海的时候你用小队频道，不需要另外找一个能随时听见你的地方。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_27"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="潮痕没有马上收起信号器。她看了一眼桌边，最后把它放进写着自己名字的布袋。袋子口留着一条小缝，谁经过都能看见里面是什么。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_28"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="还有，预报上没有写这场雨什么时候停。谁要问我，我也不知道。我们能确定的是下一处避风面，别把别的盼头当航线。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_29"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="明白。我把能靠的地方先圈出来，等出了楼背再确认。到时候要是和纸上不一样，就改纸，不去证明纸是对的。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_30"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="弗莱彻把桌角的空杯挪开，让你画完最后一道标记。门一开，雨味和凉风同时进来。潮痕踩过那块干布，终于没有再低头看自己的脚。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_31"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="上到甲板，弗莱彻让所有人把要用的东西各摸一遍。你摸到口袋里的木片，才发现自己又把铅笔落在桌上。她没有让你重来，只伸手替你扶住往后飘的包带。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_32"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="别照着别人做。你要用什么，就确认什么。帕金斯摸的是她的东西，你摸一遍她的，也不算自己带齐了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_33"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我刚才在想，一会儿要是你问路线，我不能又像第一天那样什么都答不上来。越想把它记全，别的越容易忘。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_34"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="第一天也没什么可怀念的。你把我指的岸标当成远处那座楼，差点让我们朝反方向转。我到现在都不确定，你到底有没有听见我说话。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_35"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="听见了。我没听懂“左边那个”是你的左边，还是海图的左边，又不想让大家一直等。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_36"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="弗莱彻把耳机往下拨了一点，雨声立刻变大。她问帕金斯，那天她自己回报位置时，用的又是哪一套说法。帕金斯张了张嘴，没有答上来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_37"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="所以今天说地标和方向，少说“这边”。不是每个人都站在说话的人旁边。已经会的人也得改，不能只要求新来的跟上。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_38"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="那我补一条，别用我刚丢掉的东西当标记。昨天有人说“走到德雷顿手套那儿”，我找完路，还得把手套拿回来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_39"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="这条不行。你的东西出现得比航标勤，颜色也比航标好认。我们只是合理利用已有资源。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_40"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="笑过以后，你终于把那句一直不太敢问的话说出来。要是出了海，脑子里又突然一片空白，你该先向谁报告，而不是等到有人发现。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_41"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="先说“接手”。听见的人复述你最后一道指令，再停掉没确认的部分。你不需要一口气解释自己哪里不舒服。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_42"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="我接航路，德雷顿照看你。要是我没听见，就直接叫名字。别一边难受，一边还在猜自己能不能打断别人。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_43"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="那也给我一个能做的活。别一接手就让我坐到最里面。我如果还能抄记录，或者只报看见的东西，至少让我知道。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

